1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,600
After having breakfast and those hours of pure enjoyment, I hop into work.
吃完早餐，享受过这几个小时的闲适时光后，我就投入工作。

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:12,160
I turn off airplane mode, turn my signal back on so I can check any messages I have for the day.
我关掉飞行模式，重新打开网络信号，这样就能看看今天收到的消息。

3
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:21,510
I also really like changing work locations as I'm changing the type of task, just to keep things interesting.
我也很喜欢随着任务类型的变化换一换工作地点，让事情保持一点新鲜感。

4
00:00:26,479 --> 00:00:32,479
When your body starts to get tired or your brain gets frustrated, remember to also take a break.
当身体开始疲惫，或者脑子有点烦躁时，记得也让自己休息一下。

5
00:00:32,479 --> 00:00:35,680
And no, scrolling on your phone does not count.
还有，刷手机可不算哦。

6
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:43,359
Go outside, just stare at the sky, or find a weird exercise that you can do.
到外面去，看看天空，或者找个有点奇怪、自己能做的运动。

7
00:00:43,359 --> 00:00:45,190
I have no idea how people do these.
我真不知道别人是怎么做到这些动作的。

8
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:03,100
And if you're hungry, why not go forage for a little snack?
如果饿了，何不去找点野外的小零食呢？

9
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:08,560
So sweet.
好甜。

10
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:16,479
And on mornings where I'm doing work that I don't need any Wi-Fi, I'll come to the little fold-down table in the shepherd's hut.
在那些做不需要网络的工作的早晨，我会来到牧羊人小屋里的那张小折叠桌前。

11
00:01:16,479 --> 00:01:22,400
And it's actually super great way to stay very focused when I'm doing editing or work like that.
做剪辑或类似工作时，这真是一个能让自己保持专注的好办法。

12
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:30,240
I'll probably just replicate that in the future by turning off my Wi-Fi signal if I really need to be in the zone.
以后，如果真的需要进入专注状态，我可能会通过关掉网络信号来重现这种感觉。

13
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:36,880
But also remember that, as wonderful as routines are, we shouldn't get too attached to them.
不过也要记住：习惯再好，我们也不该过分依赖它们。

14
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:39,440
Our lives are constantly changing.
我们的生活一直都在变化。

15
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:46,479
So be flexible, be open, be willing to say yes to a spontaneous morning swim.
所以，灵活一点，敞开一点，也愿意接受一次说来就来的晨泳。

16
00:01:46,479 --> 00:01:51,760
And always listen to your body, to your heart, what feels right.
也要一直听听身体和内心的感受，留意什么让自己觉得合适。

17
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:54,000
And be like water.
像水一样，顺势而行。
